abstract: >-
  R code, demonstration data, and pre-rendered figures for micro-tissue analysis,
  a workflow that groups spatially profiled tissue regions by microenvironment and
  models all measured features together to identify which genes, proteins, or cell
  types collectively drive a biological outcome. Four worked examples are provided
  on two published GeoMx Digital Spatial Profiler datasets, with a fifth
  demonstration on 10x Genomics Visium.
